      "claim": "Carnosol, a lipophilic phenolic diterpene, was detected in rat brain after administration of a rosemary extract, providing additional support that lipophilic phenolic compounds with similar physicochemical character can achieve CNS exposure.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    }
  ],
