  "decision_summary": "The query is a direct propofol analog with one isopropyl replaced by a 1-cyclopropylethyl group, preserving the lipophilic phenol pharmacophore. Propofol's well-documented rapid and extensive brain penetration, together with supporting evidence from other lipophilic phenolic/terpenoid CNS-penetrant molecules, predicts meaningful CNS access.",
